Intentional test trigger for the isolated Bharat live-news workflow.

The runner will check out only:
  umausp/agyata-pipeline-private@feat/live-broadcast-module

It must:
1. verify Ollama Cloud only and YouTube Live credentials,
2. render four fresh Hindi news explainers using the existing Shorts production engine,
3. require the existing production gate plus the additional Hindi quality and deduplication checks,
4. create an UNLISTED YouTube Live event only after the full programme is ready,
5. stream the finished programme and clean up generated files.

This marker is kept on test/live-broadcast-module and must never be merged to main.
